OL,3,GNEWSA'Starring in Ted Lasso has
OL,4,Aliterally changed my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Ted Lasso has literally changed my
OL,7,Flife."
OL,9,FRobyn Cullen usually plies her trade as
OL,10,Fa goalkeeper in the fifth tier of
OL,11,FEnglish women's football, but is now
OL,12,Fmaking as much of a name for herself
OL,13,Faway from the pitch.
OL,15,FThe 19-year-old Oxford City player
OL,16,Ffeatures as a recurring character in
OL,17,Fthe latest series of Apple TV's Ted
OL,18,FLasso - playing a goalkeeper named
OL,19,FRobyn.
